#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:5
#: 95c7fecc75ea4abe87f551e110ee4dd8
msgid "Object Avoidance with Bendy Ruler"
msgstr "使用 BendyRuler 进行避障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:10
#: 4bb54ef810b8449cb8e06c01437163be
msgid ""
"Copter and Rover support \"BendyRuler\" for path planning around obstacles "
"and fences.  The BendyRuler algorithm probes around the vehicle in many "
"directions looking for open spaces and then tries to pick the direction that"
" is sufficiently open while also moving the vehicle towards the final "
"destination."
msgstr ""
"Copter 和 Rover 支持「BendyRuler」进行障碍物和围栏周围的路径规划。BendyRuler "
"算法在飞行器周围多个方向上探测，寻找开放空间，然后尝试选择足够开阔且能将飞行器引向最终目的地的方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:14
#: f796a1e7f5b146fca309eb9f040f819e
msgid "This is only applicable in AUTO, GUIDED, and RTL flight modes."
msgstr "这仅适用于 Auto、Guided 和 RTL 飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:20
#: 154ed4a9158c4269ae036cc0d151d90e
msgid "Basic Configuration"
msgstr "基本配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:22
#: 60660583d4614d63b5ce76d3874bf22b
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_TYPE <OA_TYPE>` = 1 (BendyRuler).  You may need to refresh "
"parameters after changing this to see the parameters below."
msgstr ":ref:`OA_TYPE <OA_TYPE>` = 1（BendyRuler）。更改此参数后，您可能需要刷新参数才能看到以下参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:23
#: c33e4700e1984873a3768200a20c5a31
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_BR_LOOKAHEAD <OA_BR_LOOKAHEAD>`: This parameter is called "
"\"OA_LOOKAHEAD\" before Copter and Rover 4.1. It is the distance (in meters)"
" ahead of the vehicle that should be probed.  Obstacles further than this "
"far away will be ignored.  This should be long enough that the path around "
"obstacles can be \"seen\" but not too long or the vehicle will be overly "
"cautious and not enter areas with a lot of obstacles. 5m is typical."
msgstr ""
":ref:`OA_BR_LOOKAHEAD <OA_BR_LOOKAHEAD>`：此参数在 Copter 和 Rover 4.1 "
"之前称为「OA_LOOKAHEAD」。这是飞行器前方应被探测的距离（单位：米）。超过此距离的障碍物将被忽略。该值应足够长以「看到」绕过障碍物的路径，但不应过长，否则飞行器在障碍物密集区域会过于保守而无法进入。5m"
" 是典型值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:24
#: bed3f6edd1024fe788bc639c13d6bb84
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_MARGIN_MAX <OA_MARGIN_MAX>`: the distance (in meters) that the "
"vehicle should stay away from obstacles. 2m is a typical value."
msgstr ":ref:`OA_MARGIN_MAX <OA_MARGIN_MAX>`：飞行器应与障碍物保持的距离（单位：米）。2m 是典型值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:28
#: b6043577d0d74756b37ba19fd79e3967
msgid ""
"Users often get confused between OA_BR_LOOKAHEAD and OA_MARGIN_MAX "
"parameters. A smaller OA_BR_LOOKAHEAD will make BendyRuler look for "
"obstacles in a shorter path towards the destination, and thus any object "
"further than this many meters will not be used in the path planning process."
" A shorter OA_MARGIN_MAX parameter will let the vehicle come closer to an "
"approaching obstacle."
msgstr ""
"用户常常混淆 OA_BR_LOOKAHEAD 和 OA_MARGIN_MAX 参数。较小的 OA_BR_LOOKAHEAD 会使 BendyRuler "
"在更短的路径上寻找障碍物，因此超过该距离的物体将不会用于路径规划。较小的 OA_MARGIN_MAX 参数会让飞行器更接近接近中的障碍物。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:31
#: dbe65f636f144865bf0a8d2e274e5027
msgid "BendyRuler Types"
msgstr "BendyRuler 类型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:33
#: 8167379428f14223b2903c1c5f52db02
msgid ""
"Copter 4.1 onwards has support for two different types of BendyRuler Path "
"Planning."
msgstr "Copter 4.1 及以上版本支持两种不同类型的 BendyRuler 路径规划。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:35
#: 0bcf664ddb994ab9b6c5e0285093af23
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_BR_TYPE <OA_BR_TYPE>` = 1: Horizontal BendyRuler: This is the only "
"option available on Rover and older Copter versions. This searches for "
"obstacle-free paths only in horizontal directions and therefore when it "
"detects an obstacle in its path, it will only move in those directions."
msgstr ""
":ref:`OA_BR_TYPE <OA_BR_TYPE>` = 1：水平 BendyRuler：这是 Rover 和旧版 Copter "
"上唯一可用的选项。它仅在水平方向上搜索无障碍路径，因此当检测到路径上有障碍物时，只会向这些方向移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:42
#: 023b0a562e464e35876ea32930f053c6
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_BR_TYPE <OA_BR_TYPE>` = 2: Vertical BendyRuler: This feature "
"searches for path only in four directions: Straight towards the destination,"
" vertically up, vertically down and backwards. This feature is typically "
"helpful while avoiding short obstacles in a crowded space. Don't forget to "
"setup an altitude fence if you do not want the Copter to climb above a "
"certain height."
msgstr ""
":ref:`OA_BR_TYPE <OA_BR_TYPE>` = 2：垂直 "
"BendyRuler：此功能仅在四个方向上搜索路径：直接朝向目的地、垂直向上、垂直向下和向后。此功能在拥挤空间中规避矮小障碍物时特别有用。如果不希望 "
"Copter 爬升超过某一高度，请记得设置高度围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:49
#: 9811eee9f4054008b5996a441b9d4837
msgid "Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "高级配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:51
#: b5c32e2715b34fce99278042532a5410
msgid ""
"If using a lidar or proximity sensor the following \"obstacle database\" "
"parameters are available:"
msgstr "如果使用激光雷达或近距传感器，以下「障碍物数据库」参数可用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:53
#: 859e8a127dbe464eb707aa378721041c
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_DB_SIZE <OA_DB_SIZE>`: the maximum number of obstacles that can be "
"tracked"
msgstr ":ref:`OA_DB_SIZE <OA_DB_SIZE>`：可追踪的最大障碍物数量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:54
#: a0dd20b6339248d2978f11b39d3ce5c8
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_DB_EXPIRE <OA_DB_EXPIRE>`: the number of seconds after an obstacle "
"disappears from view that it is removed from the database"
msgstr ":ref:`OA_DB_EXPIRE <OA_DB_EXPIRE>`：障碍物从视野中消失后，从数据库中删除所需的秒数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:55
#: 48d7e508218f48ccaba431bc2a4b53af
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_DB_QUEUE_SIZE <OA_DB_QUEUE_SIZE>`: the buffer size between the "
"lidar and obstacle database.  Normally this can be left at the default value"
msgstr ""
":ref:`OA_DB_QUEUE_SIZE <OA_DB_QUEUE_SIZE>`：激光雷达与障碍物数据库之间的缓冲区大小。通常可以保持默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:56
#: ac266d1da0d24ee9bca14304b527fa9f
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_DB_OUTPUT <OA_DB_OUTPUT>`: controls whether tracked objects are "
"visible on the GCS as small airplanes"
msgstr ":ref:`OA_DB_OUTPUT <OA_DB_OUTPUT>`：控制被追踪物体是否在地面站上以小飞机图标显示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oa-bendyruler.rst:57
#: 3928005159dc4468a083d4c83d2589c4
msgid ""
":ref:`OA_DB_ALT_MIN <OA_DB_ALT_MIN>`: OADatabase will reject obstacle's if "
"vehicle's altitude above home is below this parameter, in a 3 meter radius "
"around home. This can be useful if your sensor is picking up the ground as "
"obstacles while taking off."
msgstr ""
":ref:`OA_DB_ALT_MIN <OA_DB_ALT_MIN>`：当飞行器相对 Home 的高度低于此参数时，OADatabase 将在 "
"Home 周围 3 米半径内拒绝记录障碍物。这在起飞时传感器将地面检测为障碍物时非常有用。"

